<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Your Order Has Been Delivered</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f4f5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#18181b;">

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#f4f4f5;padding:40px 20px;">
<tr>
<td align="center">

<table role="presentation" width="600" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;">

<tr>
<td style="background:#16a34a;padding:24px;text-align:center;">
<h1 style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:24px;">
{{companyName}}
</h1>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td style="padding:40px;">

<p style="margin-top:0;font-size:16px;">
Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,
</p>

<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">
Great news! Your order has been <strong>successfully delivered</strong>.
</p>

<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">
We hope everything arrived safely and met your expectations. Thank you for choosing <strong>{{companyName}}</strong>—we truly appreciate your business.
</p>

<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:30px 0;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e4e4e7;border-radius:8px;">
<tr>
<td style="padding:20px;">

<p style="margin:0 0 10px;">
<strong>Order Reference</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#16a34a;">
{{orderReference}}
</p>

<p style="margin:20px 0 10px;">
<strong>Final Status</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;">
{{statusLabel}}
</p>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:35px 0;">

<a
href="{{trackingUrl}}"
style="background:#16a34a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;">
View Order Details
</a>

</div>

<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">
If there's anything wrong with your order or you need further assistance, our support team is here to help.
</p>

<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">
Contact us anytime at
<a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color:#16a34a;text-decoration:none;">
{{supportEmail}}
</a>.
</p>

<p style="margin-top:40px;">
Thank you once again for trusting <strong>{{companyName}}</strong>. We look forward to serving you again.
</p>

<p style="margin-top:24px;">
Warm regards,<br>
<strong>The {{companyName}} Team</strong>
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td style="background:#f9fafb;padding:20px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#71717a;line-height:1.6;">
This email confirms the successful delivery of your order with {{companyName}}.
</td>
</tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>